{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36269","headline":"岁晚言事寄乡中亲友 · 方干","name":"岁晚言事寄乡中亲友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"急景苍茫昼若昏，夜风乾峭触前轩。\n寒威半入龙蛇窟，暖气全归草树根。\n蜡烬凝来多碧焰，香醪滴处有冰痕。\n尺书未达年应老，先被新春入故园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}